      "name": "BSDs",
      "description": {
        "content": "Branded short domains (BSDs) are the custom domains used to brand your links. A BSD can be added to a Bitly organization and may be assigned to one or more groups. They can contain up to 32 characters.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
